  "bio": "Easykila is a proficient tattoo artist based in Toulouse, France, known for their exceptional geometric and tribal designs. With an evident inspiration drawn from the beauty of nature, Easykila's work reflects a high level of professionalism, meticulously bringing intricate patterns to life on the skin. Their participation in various conventions highlights their commitment to the craft and the trust they've garnered within the tattoo community.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Toulouse, Occitanie, France"
